# Persist the current voxel map to disk (fortis_perception voxel_map_node).
#
# path      Destination file path (.npz). Empty = node default under map_dir
#           with a timestamped name.
# success   True if the map was written.
# message   Human-readable detail: the resolved path on success, the error
#           otherwise.

string path
---
bool success
string message
